# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated artifacts (AGENTS.md convention) — NOT committed. The pipeline
# regenerates them deterministically (seed 42) from the raw CSV, and the
# deployed apps (Streamlit dashboard / Render API) bootstrap them on first
# launch from a clean checkout. models/clv_model.pkl alone is ~51 MB, which
# also rules out committing model files.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/processed/*
models/*
!data/processed/.gitkeep
!models/.gitkeep

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw dataset — deliberately COMMITTED (override of the data/raw/* blanket
# ignore). PRD.md Section 7 requires "pipeline runs top-to-bottom with zero
# errors on a clean checkout", and Streamlit/Render cold starts rely on this
# file being present to regenerate every artifact. The .gitkeep rule keeps
# the directory structure for the regenerated artifacts.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/raw/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
!data/raw/telecom_customer_churn.csv

# Stray root-level copies of the raw data — the canonical copy lives at
# data/raw/telecom_customer_churn.csv; these Desktop leftovers are not part
# of the repo.
/telecom_customer_churn.csv
/telecom_data_dictionary.csv
/telecom_zipcode_population.csv

# orchestrator runtime state
orchestrator/runtime/

# python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/

# scratch & cache
.commandcode/
.pytest_cache/
scratch_*
*.log